 kit issues - lists the forge's milestones and iterations of the repository

   one of
   *kit issues*  lists the forge's milestones and iterations of the repository

     --text   --json   --jq
                           prints the stages as text, even on a terminal

   --stages    prints the stages, one per line, in order, the same over any workspace
   --marks     prints a mark per stage, as one JSON object, which changes when what the stage draws
               does: the forge's own mark of its milestones for milestones, null for iterations,
               which has none and is read again only on Refresh
   milestones  each milestone of the repository, open and closed, by number
   iterations  each iteration, by start: GitHub's from the projects linked to the repository,
               GitLab's with its groups', and Azure DevOps' of its team, the one
               forge_settings.ado.team names, else the project's default team
   issues      a tab kit flow prints; on a terminal it opens in kittui, and with a form it is
               refused
   backlog     the issues tab's Backlog preset; on a terminal it opens in kittui, and with a form it
               is refused
   underway    the issues tab's Underway preset; on a terminal it opens in kittui, and with a form
               it is refused


 kit issues
